From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomas Mihalicka <tomas@mihalicka.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:31:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Rename ChargeOutcome to ProviderOutcome

ChargeOutcome reads like the outcome of the payment, which is what
PaymentStatus describes. The type is only the provider's answer to one
charge, so name it after the provider. No behaviour change.

Areas: domain
---
 src/cache.rs    |  4 ++--
 src/payment.rs  | 20 +++++++++++---------
 src/ports.rs    |  6 +++---
 src/provider.rs | 24 ++++++++++++------------
 src/store.rs    |  4 ++--
 5 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

